                                "sense_id": "f1cf1ccc-ff08-3fae-82ed-d9c259c28cf7",
                                "text": "Dat er in Nederland een zesjescultuur heerst is bijna een nationale, normatieve opvatting geworden.",
                                "translation": "The existence of a culture of sixes in the Netherlands has almost become a national, normative notion.",
                                "english": "The existence of a culture of sixes in the Netherlands has almost become a national, normative notion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "000cec94-2f8f-4157-b843-474384e7a301",
                                "sense_id": "f1cf1ccc-ff08-3fae-82ed-d9c259c28cf7",
                                "text": "Het is misschien verrassend, maar de teruggekeerde jonge professionals troffen in Nederland geen zesjescultuur aan.",
                                "translation": "It may be surprising, but the young professionals who returned did not encounter a culture of sixes in the Netherlands.",
